life. today, I want to share one of my favorites from the 12 artifacts of this autumn season: storm shelter.  <br /></p><p><strong>The Question: </strong>how do I create a safe holding space to support me during stormy weather? how do I allow myself to find a little bit of solace and peace, even in the extreme discomfort? <br /><br /><strong>Storm Shelter Practice:</strong> in this artifact, I’ll walk you through creating a practice for entering, staying, and exiting your metaphorical storm shelter. <br /><br /><strong>Uses:</strong> grounding and soothing work for periods of extreme turmoil  <br /><br /><strong>Artifact Length:</strong> 10 minutes <br /><strong>Astrological Season:</strong> Libra/Scorpio <br /></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n   \n    <a href=\"https://keningzhu.notion.site/Storm-Shelter-2cc090666958801797bac0dd4e005a60\" target=\"_blank\">\n      explore this artifact\n    </a>\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n<hr /> ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"3670c5e4b5abeaf85e997e537dff537cf29a3a8c1f47b1ab02634f1d9e7d1bfe","category":"Sites"}